[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3]

; *Climb down* at a ladder's head (scripts/street/ladder_down.gd). Walking
; into the rungs climbs up; this is the way back. Placed on a landing by
; tools/street_parts/tower_climb.py, with the landing below as its marker.
; The origin sits at deck level where the rungs are; the reach covers the
; deck, so a player standing anywhere on the landing is offered the verb.

